{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Popteen3月号が発売されました〜\nひなたんも載ってます(Popでのあだ名だよっ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/02/02/6321783/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月は、みり愛も登場してます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/02/02/6321783/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バラックルームのお洋服を紹介してるよ.."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春は、\nヴィンテージガーリー\nなお洋服をいっぱいきたいな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/02/02/6321783/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リップもピンク色で\n(注目はYSLのティント！3日発売！)\n髪色も春はピンクいれたいな〜！！\n去年も春はピンクいれてたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春が待ち遠しい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非是非\nPopteen読んで春先取りしちゃいましょう！\n表紙はニコルちゃん！\n今月の表紙甘々で可愛いの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/02/02/6321783/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなももっとのれるように頑張る！\n是非みんなに手に取ってみてほしいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若い子達がいっぱい入って来たけど\nやっぱり負けたくない...>_<♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非アンケート協力お願いします！♡\nひなのお気に入りは、\n自撮りの写真のお洋服のカットかな....♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの応援が掲載数に関わります（ ; ; ）\nお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/02/02/6321783/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">_<"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/02/02/6321783/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/02/02/6321783/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明後日は節分だから\n豆でも買って1人で節分しようかな..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれって\n家に豆投げ散らかした挙句\n自分で探して拾って\n食べるんですか！？！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと疑問でした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしかしたら飛びすぎて\nテレビ台の下とかにいっちゃって\nミイラ化の可能性もありません！！？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"安全性が分かったら\n明日買って明後日豆まき実行してみます..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非豆まきファンの方教えてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"m(__)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/02/02/6321783/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事に\nたくさんのコメントありがとう（ ; ; ）\n励まされます....！\nいつもみんなの応援のおかげで頑張れるんだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/02/02/6321783/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ本当だよ。(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はね\n755に浮上してるよ〜\nよかったら遊びに来てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/02/02/6321783/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/02/02/6321783/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち"}],"source":"archive"}